  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Up-to-date labour market information system established and labour Force data  developed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia has long been in the process of having concrete and reliable data on the labour market that will serve as tools for policy formulation and development of the labour force. The absence of such information has led to a series of misunderstandings about labour market indicators such as employment and unemployment. Liberia will be conducting a Labour Force Survey (LFS) aimed at building reliable data on the labour market that will dispel misinterpretations of labour market indicators. The data will inform the government, the development partners and other data users in planning, decision making and developing policies intended to improve the welfare of the labour force.</narrative>
  </description>
